Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shibuya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it, puppet master!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.33,0:00:52.63,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,245)\bord1\shad0\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20}Ultimate Mechamaru, Mode: Absolute\N“Armored Puppet Ultimate Mechamaru Prototype 0”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My victory condition is Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:01:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to use any means\Nnecessary to get in contact
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Satoru and tell him\Nabout the Shibuya plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have him protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if I want to focus on Code,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one who lowered this veil,\NMahito is too dangerous to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to exorcise him first.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.47,0:01:18.47,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HF3FDF7&\3c&H54DCCD&\blur1\shad0}17 years 1 month 29 days
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.47,0:01:19.45,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0500E4&\3c&H050707&\blur1\shad0}16 Years
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge! One year!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.63,0:01:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn him now! Mechamaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you planning to keep burning me\Nuntil you run out of cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start by drawing you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:01:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here where I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.99,0:02:04.99,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 31\N{\fs30\fscy150}Evening Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my special.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.55,0:02:20.05,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,825)\pos(320,10)}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs16\bord0\fscy100\c&HDEDCE0&}Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what you want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what you want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sing the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.91,0:02:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sing the song.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yong, shut down. Shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I ever give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't? Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am so real. But you are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we see me on our ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall make you cry your\Nown but you are my only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are special
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mechamaru's attacks won't be\Nable to damage Mahito's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's aware of that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two years!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miracle Tanner!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you won't break off your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're not paying my\Nattacks any heed now either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I shoot you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has so much power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wait, he'll break my armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I have four chances!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to end this quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get target in your sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mechamaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point. Haven't\Nyou been paying attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was my soul destroyed too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another bird for a bad imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The left arm I blew away is regenerated?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just tweaking the shape of his soul\Nto make it look like it regenerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that he's showing\Nit off is proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show him he's not fooling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is affecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.77,0:06:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not doing badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be temporary, but his cursed\Nenergy output is special grade class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fully prepared to\Ndeal with Mahito too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending on how this goes\Nthis could be the moment I get
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pagin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell which of his attacks\Nwill actually affect my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know that\Nbefore I can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be groovy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion\NSelf-embodiment of perfection
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idle Transfiguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I touch you directly\Nor not once you're inside my domain.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.17,0:09:56.97,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1625)\an8\b1\shad0\3c&H321A1C&\pos(357,86)\frx40}9 Years 5 Months 6 Days
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you already understood that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got me that cursed\Ntechnique is sealed in these.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although it was the only way\Ni was going to be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manage this technique there's\Nonly 10 days left until
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,halloween do you think that\Nmeant i'd hold back my cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,energy and avoid using my\Ndomain give me 10 days and
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll make a full recovery i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have two left in stock this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was devised in the Heian era,\Nan era full of fierce cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spirits and curse users when\NJujutsu was at its height
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,created by Sadatsu no Ashiya\Nto protect his disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't incorporate hopes and\Ndreams into your strategy i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel so bad for you i I don't\Nknow whether to gloat or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was passed down in his school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a pact forbade his students from\Nconveying that technique to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a means for them to protect\Nthemselves from others' domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A domain for the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Shadow Style: Simple Domain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.65,0:11:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used the simple domain, but domain\Nneutralizes all other techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacks will end, even
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on Satoru Gojo when they're made within\Na domain, even if it's a simple one,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,activating it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside a domain would definitely damage\NMahito, regardless of any techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more spectating from\Nthe sidelines for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.77,0:12:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suguru Code!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a happy miscalculation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have one simple domain and\Nnine years of cursed energy left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can fight, Suguru Code!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mechamaru
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have one domain left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ram it directly into him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Mechamaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mechamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I pay you\Na visit sometime soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the exchange event, and\Nsince the baseball game too,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like we've all become\Ncloser friends to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because we all\Nwork as Jujutsu sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I feel like there was always distance\Nbetween us, even when we all got along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's because being too close
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would make it even more\Npainful when we died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's changed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.75,0:14:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love how close we've all become.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you couldn't quite play in\Nthe baseball game, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you had a pitching machine\Ntake your place on the mound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get closer to you, Mechamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So one day, I'll come to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a bit dangerous\Nfor you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made myself burst apart at the same\Ninstant that he activated his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Undoing my domain after that\Nwould make him think I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not dangerous at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that was another\Nuse of a simple domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing we got to see\Nit before the main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to finish adjusting\Nthe entrusted veil as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There won't be any problems with entrusting\Nthe cursed energy enchant to others.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.40,0:15:49.28,Main,TVTop,0,0,0,,{\pos(272.667,63.333)\fs10\shad0\bord.5\an8\3c&H886848&\c&HCEB7A6&\frz357.4}Today's Weather
