Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just after 7 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on October 31, 2018, a roughly\NMetro radius veil was lowered,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.63,0:16:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,centered around Tokyo\NDepartment Store's Tokyo Outlet.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.18,0:16:23.98,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H75EFED&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.18,0:16:23.98,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1a&HFF&\3c&HC5E3EC&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you need some more drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.73,0:16:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that a lot of people\Nare coming in for Halloween,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the way from Ibaraki and Tojigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, from out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can I get a picture with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.85,0:16:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're really cute.\NSure. Thanks a lot. Glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:16:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not do Shibuya again next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.37,0:17:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.49,0:17:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That, right there in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how many drinks have you had tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too early to be that drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.73,0:17:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, there's a wall there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hey! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:17:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
