Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.37,0:18:14.12,Sign_Basic,BuildingBanner,0,0,0,,{\an4\3c&H6D7D9E&\c&HA7BDCE&\shad0\fs14\fay-.32\pos(435.334,106.667)\fsp2\clip(m 430 96 l 640 23 640 132 612 108 605 35 572 47 576 106 436 144)}For Health Insurance, Choose
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a veil that traps\Nonly regular people inside,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.08,0:18:10.16,Main,Ijichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's a veil that traps \Nonly regular people inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and only regular people\Nare able to enter it.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.16,0:18:12.21,Main,Ijichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Regular people are only able to enter it.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.21,0:18:14.12,Main,Ijichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}It varies for windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorcerers and assistant supervisors\Nare able to come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It remains blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please use assistant supervisors like us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or first exit the veil\Nin order to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to know something?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.89,0:18:29.76,Main,Nanami,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is becoming awfully troublesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.89,0:18:29.77,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs20\bord0\shad0\pos(80,251)\b1\fscx70}Team Nanami\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\fscx60}Kento Nanami (Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer) \N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hTakuma Ino (Grade 2 Jujutsu Sorcerer) (Under Evaluation for Promotion) \N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hMegumi Fushiguro (Grade 2 Jujutsu Sorcerer) (Under Evaluation for Promotion)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has become an awfully big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro! Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know that when\Na sorcerer adds more
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effects to the barrier\Nof an existing veil,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,basically, you can only apply\Nthem to things with cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That covers people, cursed spirits\Nand cursed objects, stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So blocking cell phone signals is just\Na side effect of a veil being lowered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.05,0:18:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you can't integrate the surrounding
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,signal directly into a\Nveil's existing barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.31,0:19:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Eino, he's a very talented man, so\Nkeep the senior act in check, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anyone told Gojo?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.88,0:19:10.89,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTArial\b1\an3\fs24\bord0\shad0\pos(602,260)}Same Time, Shibuya Mark City\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N{\fscx92}Restaurant Avenue Entrance (Outside the Veil)
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.55,0:19:08.18,Main,Kugisaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}No one's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.43,Main,Kugisaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here at the scramble crossing \Nin front of the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the scramble crossing\Nin front of the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Shibuya on Halloween?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem something has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.93,0:19:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone who came running up to the edge\Nof the veil to escape said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all yelled, "Bring Satoru\NGojo!" Why there's no way?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.53,0:19:25.45,Main,Naobito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hmph.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.53,0:19:30.54,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs18\bord0\shad0\pos(74,251)\b1\fscx70}Team Zen'in\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hNaobito Zen'in (Special Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer) \N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hMaki Zen'in (Grade 4 Jujutsu Sorcerer) (Under Evaluation for Promotion)\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hNobara Kugisaki (Grade 3 Jujutsu Sorcerer) (Under Evaluation for Promotion)
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.45,0:19:28.82,Main,Naobito,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's no way any \Nnon-sorcerers know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any non-sorcerers could\Npossibly know his name they're
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.53,Main,Naobito,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're being forced to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being forced to say that\Ncan't break the veil huh
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're having a hard time with\Nit the veil isn't actually
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,preventing any sorcerers\Nfrom entering or leaving just
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.15,0:19:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't able to break it by\Nforce yet it'll be much faster
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to find out who lowered it and\Nthen go take out That curse
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,user then I suppose it's our\Nduty to help out with that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you are all going to\Nwait right here on standby
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:20:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They lowered an advanced barrier and\Ncalled out Satoru Gojo by name These
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.84,0:20:06.82,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an3\fs24\bord0\shad0\pos(606,300)\fscx70}Same Time, JR Shibuya Station South Entrance (Outside the Veil)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.23,0:20:03.90,Main,Kusakabe,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is likely the same culprits behind \Nthe attack on the exchange event.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are likely the same culprits behind\Nthe attack during the exchange event.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.90,0:20:06.82,Main,Kusakabe,0,0,0,,{\an8}The upper brass want to minimize casualties,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upper brass wants to minimize\Ncasualties So they decided
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.82,0:20:11.57,Main,Kusakabe,0,0,0,,{\an8}so they've decided to send Satoru Gojo \Nin alone to restore order to Shibuya.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.82,0:20:12.71,Sign_Basic,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\an3\fs24\fscx60\pos(606,267)}Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer (Tokyo Jujutsu High Second-year Teacher)\N{\fscx100}Atsuya Kusakabe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's best to send Satoru Gojo\Nin to restore order in Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all here on\Nstandby outside the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That includes us, Kento Nanami,\NOld Man Zenin, and Mei Mei.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.87,0:20:23.63,Main,Kusakabe,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're all here on standby outside the \Nveil to catch any of Gojo's rebounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.67,0:20:26.67,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an3\fs20\bord0\shad0\pos(602,280)\fscx85\q2}Team Kusakabe\h\h\h\h\h\hAtsuya Kusakabe (Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer)\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N{\fscx70}Panda (Grade 2 Jujutsu Sorcerer) (Promotion Evaluation Postponed)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They expect us to get\Nany of Gojo's rebounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to stay in\Ncontact once we're inside the Veil.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.63,0:20:26.67,Main,Kusakabe,0,0,0,,{\an8}We won't be able to stay in contact \Nonce we're inside the veil anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.11,0:20:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they say minimize casualties,\Nthey mean sorcerer casualties, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't care about\Ncasualties among regular people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.51,0:20:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get bristly with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.81,0:20:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike last year's Night Parade\Nof 100 Demons on Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plans were already in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to think this is the best call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I had myself a little\Nsneak peek inside the veil earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And things seemed pretty peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people panicked, but no cursed spirits\Nor curse users were trying to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The biggest problem is those\Nregular people are trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:21:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though honestly, I don't want to\Ngo back in that veil anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it was in Hakari, I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.88,0:21:11.76,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an3\fs24\bord0\shad0\pos(602,264)}Same Time, Bunkamura Street\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N{\fscx80}Dogenzaka 2-Chome East (Inside the Veil)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most likely, there's lots of\Nspecial-grade cursed spirits underground.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.71,0:21:10.76,Main,Kusakabe,0,0,0,,{\an8}Most likely, there's lots of special-grade \Ncursed spirits underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't we pass through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better hurry up and\Nbring us Satoru Gojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this Gojo? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know. But we were told we\Ncan't get out unless he comes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said that? I don't know! Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.39,0:21:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought guys weren't supposed\Nto panic at times like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, being trapped is like\Nsomething out of a horror film.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're not really in\Nthat much trouble, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, somebody's called for help.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.66,0:21:38.41,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\and8\fs16\pos(346,174.666)\c&HE0EDFF&\frz13.41\fax.1}Wednesday, October 31
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.66,0:21:38.41,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\fs12\c&H6D5D8B&\frz13.41\fax.1\an7\3c&HCCC5F7&\pos(273,248)}Connection Error\NUnable to Connect to Network
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have no signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.59,0:21:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you not see what happened earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sucked into the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happened to the people\Nwho got in the intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like they were water going\Ndown a bathtub drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.85,0:21:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't seen that, I'd be\Ngoing home on the train too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you use your brain\Na little bit, you dumb fucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:22:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about you tell us how\Nsmart people can pass through?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.31,0:22:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.65,0:22:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.98,0:22:09.98,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,282)\fnArial\b1\fs30\bord0\shad0}20:31 Satoru Gojo Arrives
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.09,0:22:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.95,0:23:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to go buy melon bread, but\Nthis is chocolate chip melon bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously it's way better\Nwith chocolate chips!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.39,0:23:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're as different as fried\Ntaters and Gundam models!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.21,0:23:55.01,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}The Shibuya Incident
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.49,0:23:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the Shibuya incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what they are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I built an AC model before.

